<p>Inflicts <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> temporal damage.  If your target survives, it may be removed from time for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>